# Project: Finja - Twitch Interactivity Suite
# Module: finja-youtube / .dockerignore
# Author: J. Apps (JohnV2002 / Sodakiller1)
# Version: 1.2.0
# Description: The Dockerfile uses COPY . . - everything private or test-only must stay out.
# New in v1.2.0: private/ (real cookies), .env, cookie exports, screenshots, tests and contract
#   tooling are excluded (before, a cookies.json in the folder was baked into the image).
